---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Over mij - Rob Lohmann" 
  description="Meer informatie over Rob Lohmann"
>
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">Over mij</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">
        Hi, ik ben Rob Lohmann, een software developer met een passie voor .NET, Azure, en moderne web development.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 border-l-4 border-primary pl-4">Expertise</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-white border border-primary rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-primary">.NET & C#</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Backend development met moderne .NET frameworks</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-secondary rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-secondary">Azure & Cloud Development</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Cloud architectuur en Azure services</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-accent rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-accent">Kubernetes & Docker</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Container orchestration en deployment</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-dark rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-dark">SQL & PostgreSQL</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Database design en optimalisatie</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-400 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-gray-700">Modern Web Development</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Frontend frameworks en tooling</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Je kunt me vinden op GitHub en LinkedIn. Ik ben altijd open voor interessante projecten en samenwerkingen.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/roblohmann" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
           class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-dark text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors">
          🔗 GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/roblohmann" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
           class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-accent transition-colors">
          💼 LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
